%F A183889 From _Mikhail Smirnov_, Nov 11 2026: (Start)
%F A183889 a(n) = 7^(n+3) - (25*n^3 + 330*n^2 + 1451*n + 2154)*2^n - (13*n^5 + 107*n^4 + 246*n^3 - 236*n^2 - 1762*n - 2046) for n >= 4.
